        "original_id": "23227079-1a7b-58c0-ab29-1386ec623f8b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Schneider, Tom Wopat, James Best, Tyler Perry, Alicia Witt, Dedee Pfeiffer, Alan Rosenberg, Christine Baranski\n- TV Series: The Dukes of Hazzard, Smallville, The Haves and the Have Nots, Cybill\n- Roles: Beauregard \"Bo\" Duke, Lucas K. \"Luke\" Duke, Jonathan Kent, James \"Jim\" Cryer, Maryann\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Wopat first achieved fame as Lucas K. \"Luke\" Duke on the television action/comedy series \"The Dukes of Hazzard.\"\n- John Schneider is best known for portraying Beauregard \"Bo\" Duke in \"The Dukes of Hazzard,\" opposite Tom Wopat and James Best.\n- John Schneider is also best known for portraying Jonathan Kent in the 2001–2011 television series \"Smallville,\" an adaptation of \"Superman.\"\n- John Schneider is also best known for portraying James \"Jim\" Cryer in the television series \"The Haves and the Have Nots,\" which was created by Tyler Perry.\n- In the television series \"Cybill,\" Alicia Witt and Dedee Pfeiffer co-starred as Sheridan's daughters.\n- In \"Cybill,\" Alan Rosenberg and Tom Wopat played the respective fathers of Sheridan's daughters.\n- In \"Cybill,\" Christine Baranski appeared as Cybill's hard-drinking friend Maryann.",
